OL,3,AMajor tech stocks plunge as US midterms
OL,4,Aadd to fears of AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of billions of dollars in
OL,7,Fmarket value has been wiped from major
OL,8,Ftech firms in a stock market rout after
OL,9,Fthe US midterm elections sparked
OL,10,Fconcerns of a slowdown in AI
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
OL,13,FShares in firms across the tech and
OL,14,Fartificial intelligence sectors
OL,15,Fplummeted following Democratic wins
OL,16,Fafter election campaigns run on slowing
OL,17,FAI.
